# Alembic migratsiyalar

Bu papkada ma'lumotlar bazasi migratsiyalari saqlanadi.

## Buyruqlar

```bash
# Joriy versiyani ko'rish
alembic current

# Tarixni ko'rish
alembic history

# Yangi migratsiya yaratish (avtomatik)
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "tavsif"

# Yangi migratsiya yaratish (qo'lda)
alembic revision -m "tavsif"

# Eng oxirgi versiyaga o'tish
alembic upgrade head

# 1 qadam orqaga
alembic downgrade -1

# Muayyan versiyaga o'tish
alembic upgrade <revision_id>

# Muayyan versiyaga qaytish
alembic downgrade <revision_id>
